   USING %_ICHARG
   CHANGING VALUE.
  PERFORM CB_CALLBACK_VALUE_GET(SAPLSEUJ)
   USING %_ICHARG
   CHANGING OLD_VALUE.
WHEN 'OPDATE'.
  PERFORM CB_CALLBACK_VALUE_GET(SAPLSEUJ)
   USING %_OPDATE
   CHANGING VALUE.
  PERFORM CB_CALLBACK_VALUE_GET(SAPLSEUJ)
